{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>And you shall circumcise him, then he may eat of it.</b> His master — this teaches that the circumcision of one's slaves disqualifies him from eating the Paschal offering, the words of Rabbi Yehoshua. Rabbi Eliezer says: the circumcision of one's slaves does not disqualify him from eating the Paschal offering. If so, what does Scripture say <b>then he may eat of it</b>? — the slave."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:49.713559114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}